# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Cc — Pattern Syntax
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# Syntax Rules:
#   - Blank lines are ignored
#   - Lines starting with # are comments
#   - ! negates a pattern (includes previously excluded)
#   - / at end means directory only
#   - * matches anything except /
#   - ** matches across directories

# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Co — Ignore Patterns
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ─── Biblical Foundation ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Scripture texts are large and static — committed once, then frozen.

word/scripture/
.a-new-structure/**/scripture/

# ─── CPI-SI Runtime ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Source tracked, binaries and runtime state ignored.

