# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Cv — Validation and Security
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# Verify Commands:
#   git check-ignore -v [file]    # Check if file would be ignored
#   git status --ignored          # List all ignored files
#   git rm --cached [file]        # Untrack already-committed file
#
# Common Issues:
#   "File still tracked" — Already committed files need: git rm --cached [file]
#   "Pattern not working" — Check for typos, trailing spaces
#   "Too many files ignored" — Pattern may be too broad, use ! to negate
#
# If secrets were accidentally committed:
#   1. Rotate ALL exposed credentials immediately
#   2. Use BFG or git filter-repo to remove from history
#   3. Force push (coordinate with team)

